<item>
<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-21T19:35:09.017Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:35:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces are now conducting airstrikes and ground assaults on Haitian gang leaders, including an airstrike on Jeff's mansion and demolition of another stronghold, killing about 20 gang members. Haitian police raids in Port-au-Prince have killed at least 34 suspected gang members. Two Salvadoran soldiers died while handling explosives during operations in Haiti. The UN chief condemned a recent attack that killed 47 people, and the EU imposed sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. The conflict has caused 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9wUlBYcllxTFRiOTJjeTF2aFIyVFMxWnF5b2ctOXROX2RJbG5xRGdyUE5xTl9pcnZwMG05VVpfVWlUS0NULWpKa0RuV1RfWG1kNGJENWxqcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNdUpnajZydnpaU3U0WjBwVHl4U3Uzckc2Q2JUY01IWjJEQXRyUmlrTXloVXpGVTlWbDRteER3bXNUY2w1bVFSVzk2TDNrQzBGenRqM0RfUm4xOWtCYnJWWnNBbHVuaHk0Vm9nLVpQcC1yYzNsV0FUX0xvMnVZbGVhRHF2bzNXNTNIeW9vQlR2LWR6b05nTlBWSHRLZm5lN2lROU5BSkRfYVo?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOMWhuZTdFeE9pUGRsTmNCV3EyWHE3eFdhM1BKT0tIZmhZb2xpUXllakJORFB4MWl6U0Eyc1BFRE02aEhhOWxvWm1QS29lMjNHOHhFblhXWHpIbWJ0YmtCb3RfdDBBTWhrUGN4Y3FSVk1mY1c5WlNqdXh3MWRzQlpmMUplSW9OZEVYOWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxQZ3Qwa1U0THlNRHgzUWticlAwM1FRT1AxZFd0a1BnX1Z2T1NqNTZyaHhpdjJKRUdMQ2pwMHpzZFp0TE91RXJ4bmZuSmd6cWRmWE1LSWl1TFJpRkswLWR0T2hMNHRXWTdXNW51UXpMVEEyNDZPTHZtYzBrS0pZb1VpZ2w2TG4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;